  "statement": "# Hazard Circuit — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nRead the rhythm of a machine-like obstacle course, fail cheaply, learn quickly, and chain movement through the complete circuit.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded 2D parkour platformer with multiple hazard combinations, fast recovery, checkpoints or retries, and full-course completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the act count, movement details, hazard timing, checkpoint spacing, and industrial presentation.\n"
